# Crash and timeout reproducers libFuzzer drops in the working directory.
# The seed corpus itself is tracked: it is what makes a fresh clone's `make
# fuzz` start from the vectors rather than from nothing.
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
slow-unit-*

# libFuzzer's own discoveries during a campaign are not tracked; the seed
# corpus is, and `make fuzz-seed` puts the directories back to it. See
# tools/fuzz/seed.py for why.
